<title>FINLAND: TRADING VOLUME ON FINNISH SOM RISES IN JULY.</title>
<headline>TRADING VOLUME ON FINNISH SOM RISES IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of trading on the Finnish derivatives  exchange (SOM) rose to 528,146 contracts in July from 457,757 in June  and 183,758 contracts in July 1996, SOM said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>In the 12 months to end July, the volume of trading increased 166  percent year-on-year to nearly 6.5 million contracts, SOM said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
